<TITLE>Stabilizer</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>A front stabilizer is provided as standard on all models to ensure sufficient roll rigidity.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>Ball joint type stabilizer links are used. By attaching them to the shock absorbers, responsiveness from the initial stage of roll is increased and the stabilizer effect is improved, achieving both steering stability and ride comfort.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
